# Instance ID for this Waystation deployment.
#
# On first run (no /data/.waystation-instance-id sentinel yet), the app generates a UUID,
# writes it to the sentinel file, and prints it with instructions to paste it here. Leave
# this unset until you've seen that output — copy the generated ID, don't invent your own.
#WAYSTATION_INSTANCE_ID=

# Host path (or network mount) bound to the container's /app/data.
#
# Defaults to ./data if unset. Point this at a Tailscale-connected NAS mount, etc. for
# off-VPS storage. This is a host-level decision only — the app never knows or cares
# whether it's local disk or a network mount.
#WAYSTATION_DATA_DIR=./data